-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
llama.cpp and ggml
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
On-device inference is provided by llama.cpp and its tensor library ggml.

    llama.cpp   https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
    ggml        https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2023-2024 The ggml authors

llama.cpp is consumed as a git submodule at third_party/llama.cpp and compiled
into libllama/libggml shared libraries that are packaged in the APK. Builds made
with the default -Pollama.nativeSource=none contain no llama.cpp or ggml code.

The full MIT licence text for llama.cpp and ggml appears in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.

